  "requirements": {
    "03.1": "Two fixed VM descriptors (0xE3/0xE4), two IPS overloads, eight scalar namespace constants; shared scalar sampling and one F1/F2 scan. Validator rejects wrong types/aux; resource results never constant-fold.",
